      "title": "A comment-shaped repair MUST be representable: at an unmoved head after a \u0060changes-required\u0060 verdict, a valid \u0060RepairAssertionReceipt\u0060 MUST route to the same-critic confirmation state in BOTH the ordinary and repair phases, through ONE shared guard function. (covers AC-007, AC-013)",
